		"description": "<p><em>Toolbelt upgrade of your <strong>Ether Capacitator</strong> gadget — use this instead of the gadget item to activate it with the greater effect for 2 Toolbelt scraps total.</em></p><p><em>Gadget — Harvests magical damage into Toolbelt scraps.</em></p><p><strong>Reaction:</strong> When you take magical damage. Regain 2 Toolbelt scraps.</p><p><strong>Toolbelt:</strong> Reduce the incoming damage by half.</p><p><strong>Passive:</strong> +2 maximum Toolbelt scraps.</p><hr><p><em>[A] Spends 2 Toolbelt scraps — tracked on the sheet (click the counter to correct mistakes).</em></p><p><em>[A] Regains 2 Toolbelt scraps.</em></p><p><em>[M] Halve the triggering damage when it is applied.</em></p>",
